{
  "_meta": {
    "name": "ERNIE-Image Turbo Edit (Inpaint) + PE",
    "description": "ERNIE-Image Turbo 图片编辑（通用 inpaint，8 步）+ Prompt Enhancer（Ministral3 PE 增强提示词）。PE 链复用 CLIPLoader(type=flux2) + TextGenerate 标准节点",
    "variant": "ernie-image-turbo-gguf-q4-k-m",
    "mode": "edit",
    "default_steps": 8,
    "default_guidance": 1.0,
    "supports_pe": true,
    "placeholders": {
      "__PROMPT__": "正向提示词（PE 增强前的原始提示词，必填）",
      "__NEGATIVE_PROMPT__": "负向提示词（默认空）",
      "__WIDTH__": "宽度（edit 模式下为源图实际尺寸，PE 系统提示词使用）",
      "__HEIGHT__": "高度（同上）",
      "__STEPS__": "推理步数（默认 8）",
      "__CFG__": "引导系数（默认 1.0）",
      "__SEED__": "随机种子（默认 0=随机）",
      "__GGUF_FILENAME__": "GGUF 主权重文件名",
      "__VAE_FILENAME__": "VAE 文件名",
      "__TEXT_ENCODER_FILENAME__": "Text Encoder 文件名",
      "__PE_FILENAME__": "PE 权重文件名（含 tekken_model 的 model_with_tokenizer.safetensors）",
      "__PE_PROMPT__": "PE 系统提示词（engine.py 构建，含 <s>[SYSTEM_PROMPT]...[/INST] 模板，width/height 用源图实际尺寸）",
      "__SOURCE_IMAGE__": "源图文件名（引擎落盘到 ComfyUI input 目录，{task_id}_source.png）",
      "__MASK_IMAGE__": "mask 文件名（引擎归一化后落盘，{task_id}_mask.png，白=重绘区）"
    },
    "notes": [
      "PE（Prompt Enhancer）基于 Ministral3 模型，用 CLIPLoader(type=flux2) 加载",
      "TextGenerate 节点执行 LLM 推理生成增强 prompt，输出接正向 CLIPTextEncode",
      "节点链：LoadImage + LoadImageMask(channel=red) → VAEEncodeForInpaint(grow_mask_by=6) → KSampler(denoise=1.0) → VAEDecode → SaveImage",
      "mask 语义：白色（255）= 重绘区；denoise 固定 1.0，重绘区域由 noise_mask 控制",
      "use_default_template=false：跳过 ComfyUI 默认模板，使用 engine.py 构建的完整 <s>[SYSTEM_PROMPT] 模板"
    ]
  },
  "1": {
    "class_type": "UnetLoaderGGUF",
    "inputs": {
      "unet_name": "__GGUF_FILENAME__"
    }
  },
  "2": {
    "class_type": "CLIPLoader",
    "inputs": {
      "clip_name": "__TEXT_ENCODER_FILENAME__",
      "type": "flux2"
    }
  },
  "10": {
    "class_type": "CLIPLoader",
    "inputs": {
      "clip_name": "__PE_FILENAME__",
      "type": "flux2"
    }
  },
  "11": {
    "class_type": "TextGenerate",
    "inputs": {
      "clip": ["10", 0],
      "prompt": "__PE_PROMPT__",
      "max_length": 2048,
      "sampling_mode": "on",
      "sampling_mode.temperature": 0.6,
      "sampling_mode.top_k": 64,
      "sampling_mode.top_p": 0.8,
      "sampling_mode.min_p": 0.05,
      "sampling_mode.repetition_penalty": 1.05,
      "sampling_mode.seed": 0,
      "thinking": false,
      "use_default_template": false
    }
  },
  "3": {
    "class_type": "CLIPTextEncode",
    "inputs": {
      "text": ["11", 0],
      "clip": ["2", 0]
    }
  },
  "4": {
    "class_type": "CLIPTextEncode",
    "inputs": {
      "text": "__NEGATIVE_PROMPT__",
      "clip": ["2", 0]
    }
  },
  "5": {
    "class_type": "LoadImage",
    "inputs": {
      "image": "__SOURCE_IMAGE__"
    }
  },
  "6": {
    "class_type": "LoadImageMask",
    "inputs": {
      "image": "__MASK_IMAGE__",
      "channel": "red"
    }
  },
  "7": {
    "class_type": "VAELoader",
    "inputs": {
      "vae_name": "__VAE_FILENAME__"
    }
  },
  "8": {
    "class_type": "VAEEncodeForInpaint",
    "inputs": {
      "pixels": ["5", 0],
      "vae": ["7", 0],
      "mask": ["6", 0],
      "grow_mask_by": 6
    }
  },
  "9": {
    "class_type": "KSampler",
    "inputs": {
      "model": ["1", 0],
      "positive": ["3", 0],
      "negative": ["4", 0],
      "latent_image": ["8", 0],
      "seed": "__SEED__",
      "steps": "__STEPS__",
      "cfg": "__CFG__",
      "sampler_name": "euler",
      "scheduler": "simple",
      "denoise": 1.0
    }
  },
  "12": {
    "class_type": "VAEDecode",
    "inputs": {
      "samples": ["9", 0],
      "vae": ["7", 0]
    }
  },
  "13": {
    "class_type": "SaveImage",
    "inputs": {
      "images": ["12", 0],
      "filename_prefix": "ERNIE_Image_EDIT_PE"
    }
  }
}
